[[Jaguar warrior]]s (also known as meleers) are enemies in the Colosseum armed with a pair of claws. These enemies only appear as reinforcements from waves 1-6.

Their claws will allow them to strike the player three times per attack. Each of these attacks makes their own independent roll on accuracy and damage like that of [[nail beast]]s. With a maximum hit of 47 and high melee stats, this means that the warrior can easily kill players, potentially dealing up to 141 damage in a single attack. Therefore, keep Protect Melee on at '''all times''' if the warrior is not in position and isolate them from other enemies to avoid such a scenario.

